(
    title: "Dark Cavern",
    description: Some("Trapped in an underground maze once the trap door locks behind you, you shoot it out with robots while spiders and bullet-stealing blobs pour in through the side doors. Ammunition is tight — one shot on screen at a time, topped up by landing on a briefly-flashing gun — and destroying a yellow robot earns an extra man. The left difficulty switch swaps one-headed robots for four faster-respawning two-headed ones."),
